         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nEveryone has a personal way of writing. Forcing one single way on everybody would take away that freedom.\n\nWhen writing Etruscan-Roman and Mesoamerican numbers, writers could choose the form they found most meaningful — or even most beautiful.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
