         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Number Before\n\nSo far, we have seen that Etruscan-Roman numbers grow by adding symbols to the right. But some numbers are written by placing a symbol before another — instead of after it.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
