         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we saw that Etruscan-Roman and Mesoamerican peoples were both free to write numbers — but in different ways. This supports the idea that they developed their number systems independently.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
